          "title": "You'll want to know: तलवार",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "तलवार — talvār — \"a sword\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "संग्रहालयात एक जुनी तलवार ठेवली आहे. saṅgrahālayāt ek junī talvār ṭhevlī āhe. An old sword is kept in the museum."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural तलवारी."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "तलवार (talvār) is a tadbhava: CDIAL lists Marathi tarvār, 'a one-edged sword', under Sanskrit taravāri (CDIAL 5706); standard Marathi writes it with l for r."
            }
          ]
        },
